    "detailed_description": "<i>&quot;You won't be challenged, here is what's left.&quot;            \u2014\u2014 Toji Molabi</i><br><br>The Simplest Game in the World is a narrative video game that pokes and prods ideas of a game being simple, or being otherwise. The gameplay is intentionally straightforward, just so we see what can be achieved by simply key pressing.<br><br>Expect a short hike, but also expect distractions since chambers arise as you explore, offering chances to take a deeper peek inside.<br><br>That said, feel free to dive in and break the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPORT</h2>For any issues with the game, please report them to this email: <br><a href=\"mailto:kezhou.makesgames@gmail.com\">kezhou.makesgames@gmail.com</a>",
